    "visibleText": "Discover the Future with Our Valued Silver Sponsor MySQL – PyCon HK 2023 - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Discover the Future with Our Valued Silver Sponsor MySQL – PyCon HK 2023 Posted on October 10, 2023 July 20, 2025 MySQL is the World’s Most Popular Open Source Database. It powers the most innovative companies including Facebook, Booking, Uber, and Tesla. It is available on-premises and as the MySQL Database Service on Oracle Cloud. For developers, it’s an easy to use, reliable and high-performance database with NoSQL and SQL support. SaaS, ecommerce, financial, telecom, and Fortune 1000 companies rely on the MySQL Enterprise edition advanced security features to protect the privacy of information, prevent data breaches and help meet regulatory requirements such as GDPR, PCI, HIPAA. MySQL High Availability has native HA, fully integrated into the MySQL Server for 99.99% uptime. Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020-fall 2020-spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← Discover the Future with Our Valued Gold Sponsor PSF – PyCon HK 2023 ← Discover the Future with Our Valued Silver Sponsor PCCW-HKT – PyCon HK 2023"
