    "visibleText": "Sponsors – PyCon HK 2023 - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Sponsors – PyCon HK 2023 Posted on October 10, 2023 July 20, 2025 PyCon Hong Kong 2023 extends our heartfelt gratitude to our sponsors for their unwavering support. Their contributions are invaluable in spreading Python and championing the open-source cause. Please click on sponsor logos for further sponsor messages: Platinum Sponsor Gold Sponsor Silver Sponsor Bronze Sponsor Prize Sponsor Networking Hour Partner Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020-fall 2020-spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← Booths – PyCon HK 2023 ← Discover the Future with Our Valued Platinum Sponsor Red Hat – PyCon HK 2023"
