-->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\n<p>Volunteers for PyCon Hong Kong 2023 are the essential builders of this conference. We deeply appreciate their countless months of hard work, making all of this possible (listed in alphabetical order by last name) :</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Executive Committee</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Mr. Arnold Chan<br>Mr. Calvin Chong<br>Ms. Daisy Maris Fung<br>Mr. Sammy Fung<br>Ms. Ho, Cheuk Ting (Cherrie)<br>Mr. Ivan Ip<br>Mr. Scotty Kwok<br>Mr. Henry Law<br>Mr. Kingman Leung<br>Mr. Adrian Tam<br>Mr. Kaki Ting<br>Mr. Calvin Tsang<br>Ms. Peggy Wong<br>Mr. Ronald Yick<br>Mr. Ted Yuen</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Programme Vetting Committee</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Mr. Albert Au Yeung<br>Mr. Arnold Chan<br>Mr. Calvin Chong<br>Mr. Scotty Kwok<br>Mr. Adrian Tam<br>Mr. James Tang<br>Mr. Calvin Tsang<br>Ms. Winnie Yeung</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">On-Site Volunteers</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Mr. Tommy Han<br>Mr. Ronald Hung<br>Mr. Sam, Lam Hok Man<br>Mr. Leo Kwok<br>Mr. Charles Paul<br>Mr. Wilson Yau<br>Mr. Kelvin Yiu<br>Ms. Judy Wong<br>Mr. Wilson</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t</article><!-- #post-2043 -->\n\n\t\t</main><!-- #main -->\n\t</div><!-- #primary -->\n\n\n<aside id=\"secondary\" class=\"featured-sidebar widget-area\">\n\t<section id=\"block-9\" class=\"fbox swidgets-wrap widget widget_block\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-social-links aligncenter is-layout-flex wp-block-social-links-is-layout-flex\"><li class=\"wp-social-link wp-social-link-instagram  wp-block-social-link\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/pyconhk/\" class=\"wp-block-social-link-anchor\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12,4.622c2.403,0,2.688,0.009,3.637,0.052c0.877,0.04,1.354,0.187,1.671,0.31c0.42,0.163,0.72,0.358,1.035,0.673 c0.315,0.315,0.51,0.615,0.673,1.035c0.123,0.3