    "visibleText": "[Closed] PyCon HK 2023 – Call For Proposal - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK [Closed] PyCon HK 2023 – Call For Proposal Posted on July 18, 2023 July 18, 2023 The Call for Proposal (CFP) of PyCon Hong Kong 2023 is now closed! With the overwhelming responses we received this year: receiving almost 60 proposals. There are a lot of high-quality submissions covering a wide spectrum of Python topics. The program committee members are all excited to go through such an impressive list of proposals! In the coming month, the program committee will carefully review each submission and curate the program schedule for PyCon Hong Kong 2023, which will take place on November 11! Please stay tuned for further updates and details about the program! Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020-fall 2020-spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← PyCon HK 2023 – Call For Proposal ← Get Ready for the Blind Bird Ticket of PyCon HK 2023!"
