    "visibleText": "Introduce to you! about PyLadies Tokyo - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Introduce to you! about PyLadies Tokyo Posted on October 10, 2023 July 20, 2025 Time Slot: Track 2 10:20-10:50 Language: English Speaker: Ms. Maaya Ishida | Microsoft Japan / PyLadies Tokyo / PyCon JP Association | Japan This session is my community’s activity reports. Start to “what’s the PyLadies Tokyo ” , introduce to activity such as annual event and other women tech communities or PyCon JP Association collaborate event. And I would like to talk about how we are organizing and the mindset of the organizing team. Ms. Maaya Ishida I’m leader of PyLadies Tokyo. I’ve also been helping PyLadies Caravan, which is for live in outside of Tokyo area run by PyCon JP Association. We have been on hiatus since 2019, but I was leader of Geek Women Japan conference, which is an event featuring only women engineers as speakers. This conference attracted about 300 attendees. Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020-fall 2020-spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← Accelerating NetworkX: Fast Graph Analytics with Python ← Streamlit — Creating Interactive Websites with Ease"
