    "visibleText": "Get Ready for the Blind Bird Ticket of PyCon HK 2023! - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Get Ready for the Blind Bird Ticket of PyCon HK 2023! Posted on July 21, 2023 July 21, 2023 Mark your calendars! On August 8, 2023, at 8:00 PM, the Blind Bird Tickets for PyCon HK 2023 will go on sale! 🎉 🕊️ What is a Blind Bird Ticket? 🕊️ Snatch this exclusive opportunity to secure your spot at PyCon HK 2023 with a Blind Bird Ticket! Enjoy a fabulous discount, just like our Early Bird Tickets, for an event that’s packed with surprises – from captivating speakers to extraordinary sessions. Buy your ticket early, and you’ll be soaring with joy throughout the conference. Who knows, there might be some amazing special perks awaiting you too! 🌟 🔥 Why is the Blind Bird Ticket so special? 🔥 Act fast! The number of Blind Bird Tickets is incredibly limited, available on a first-come, first-serve basis. Don’t miss out on this golden opportunity to grab your spot at one of the hottest tech conferences of the year! 🎟️ 🚀 Don’t Delay, Seize Your Chance! 🚀 Join us at PyCon HK 2023 and immerse yourself in a world of innovation, inspiration, and open source wonders. Be part of a vibrant community that’s pushing boundaries, exchanging ideas, and shaping the future of technology. Get ready to elevate your skills, network with brilliant minds, and experience an unforgettable conference that will leave you inspired and motivated. Stay tuned for the ticket release, and don’t let this fantastic opportunity fly away. Mark your calendars for August 8, 2023, at 8:00 PM, and be one of the first to grab your Blind Bird Ticket for PyCon HK 2023! 🎟️🌟 See you at the conference! 🤝 Get Blind Bird Ticket on 2023/8/8 準備好了嗎？PyCon HK 2023 盲鳥票即將開賣！ 2023 年 8 月 8 日晚上 8 時，PyCon HK 2023 盲鳥票將正式開始售賣！🎉 🕊️ 什麼是盲鳥票？🕊️ 抓住這個獨家機會，享受驚人折扣，就像早鳥票一樣，參加 PyCon HK 2023 這個充滿驚喜的活動——從引人入勝的演講者到精彩的議程。越早購票，在整個大會中的樂趣也就越多：更可能會有一些特別福利等著你！🌟 🔥 為什麼盲鳥票如此特別？🔥 行動要快！盲鳥票數量非常有限，先到先得。別錯過難得機會，在一年一度的頂級科技盛會上，確保你的位置！🎟️ 🚀 不要猶豫，把握機會！🚀 加入我們，參加 PyCon HK 2023，沉浸於創新、充滿靈感及奇思妙想的開源世界。成為這個充滿活力社群的一員，探索潛能，交流想法，塑造科技的未來。快快準備提升你的技能，與卓越的友好賢達建立聯繫，體驗難忘的大會，讓你充滿靈感與動力。 請密切留意開售時間：2023 年 8 月 8 日晚上 8 時，成為第一批搶購 PyCon HK 2023 盲鳥票的人！🎟️🌟 我們在大會見！🤝 2023/8/8 搶盲鳥票 Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020-fall 2020-spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← [Closed] PyCon HK 2023 – Call For Proposal ← PyCon HK 2023: Get Your Early Bird Ticket Now!"
