    "description": "Time Slot: Track 2 17:00-1730 Language: Cantonese Speaker: Dr. Cathie So | Privacy & Scaling Explorations Team (Ethereum Foundation) | Hong Kong In this hands-on workshop, participants will gain practical experience in building ZKML circuits using the keras2circom and/or EZKL transpiler. We will begin with an overview of the current state of zero-knowledge machine learning and its",
